120-121-122-123-124-125-126-127	299,981,1535,1843	Pinnately: 120, 122, 124, 126. Palmately: 121, 123, 125, 127. Lobed. Cleft. Parted. Divided.	Two rows of four outline leaves: above, feather-veined leaves lobed, cleft, parted and divided towards the midrib (120, 122, 124, 126); below, palmately veined leaves cut the same four ways towards the footstalk (121, 123, 125, 127).
